{
 "name": "HL · Prospects · morning approval",
 "nodes": [
  {
   "parameters": {
    "content": "## HL · Prospects: morning approval (Lesson 5.2)\nEvery weekday at 07:30 Tolu gets each drafted prospect on Telegram: business name (fetched fresh from Google by place ID), fit score, reasons, the fact with its source link, and the draft. She chooses Approve, Edit or Skip. Nothing sends without her.\n\nCredentials: Header Auth \"Google Places key\" on Fresh place details; Google Sheets; Telegram.\nPlaceholders: YOUR_SHEET_ID, YOUR_TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID.",
    "height": 320,
    "width": 460
   },
   "id": "d7092409-40bc-4727-b6ac-c3b6bcdae4ed",
   "name": "Note 1",
   "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
   "typeVersion": 1,
   "position": [
    -520,
    -260
   ]
  },
  {
   "parameters": {
    "rule": {
     "interval": [
      {
       "field": "cronExpression",
       "expression": "30 7 * * 1-5"
      }
     ]
    }
   },
   "id": "7f66bd79-79dc-4177-a814-de36527047aa",
   "name": "Weekdays 07:30",
   "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
   "typeVersion": 1.2,
   "position": [
    0,
    0
   ]
  },
  {
   "parameters": {
